f&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=292092638393e381252ab883b532d3d9", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/43d91aee/uploads/origins/e77debe2-7253-4dbd-b1ea-d62b18e168a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=292092638393e381252ab883b532d3d9, https://si.imgix.net/43d91aee/uploads/origins/e77debe2-7253-4dbd-b1ea-d62b18e168a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=431cc1d0dc2c41e19ebb27683738c436 2x, https://si.imgix.net/43d91aee/uploads/origins/e77debe2-7253-4dbd-b1ea-d62b18e168a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3f1a2d06173f7857d644be5dfac60642 3x"}, "body": "Good evening, Ameko!\nI would like to ask you to draw an illustration of a character created in a TRPG. I would be very happy if you could draw two people at the seaside as an image. ...... (If you have any other ideas, I'd love to see them too!)\n\n⚫︎Kira Mirume (15) female\nMaterial: https://x.com/toricuntori/status/1687034609396281350?s=46\nCheerful/ bright/ powerful\n\nBorn and raised on an island, 15 years old.\nLoves sparkling things, enjoys finding stained glass and large seashells at the beach\nWatamoto-san found her washed up on the beach one day\n\n⚫︎ Rei Watamoto (25) male\n\nMaterial https://x.com/hannhuuki/status/1691467725271666689\ncheerful/ smiling (calm)/ kind\n\nUsually works as a salesman\nKind and basically devoted\nHe is the type of person who will intervene when there is a fight.\nOne day, he was found by Kira when he was washed up on the beach\n\n→How do they feel about each other?\nMirume Kira recognizes Rei Watamoto as the one whom she likes, including romantic feelings, and is the only sparkling and important person for her.\nRei Watamoto thinks of Mirume Kira as a cute niece. She seems to be a teacher who was confessed by a kindergarten student in a sense.\n\nOverview of the TRPG that passed (jump to BOOTH). No spoilers if you just follow the link and read the summary)\n\nhttps://booth.pm/ja/items/1712065\n\nI've written a lot of settings, but I'd be happy if you could depict the two in your interpretation of Ameko-san! Thank you very much.", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@nanmoneena/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1693189, "client_id": 1853178, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/74a0c2eb/uploads/origins/318d2c77-a0c0-4693-a783-ce67d35d7cbf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=18ab4ca4f64ff824af04afd0c1e539ce", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/74a0c2eb/uploads/origins/318d2c77-a0c0-4693-a783-ce67d35d7cbf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=18ab4ca4f64ff824af04afd0c1e539ce, https://si.imgix.net/74a0c2eb/uploads/origins/318d2c77-a0c0-4693-a783-ce67d35d7cbf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e4d91b04b33db90a07ff339c65583c76 2x, https://si.imgix.net/74a0c2eb/uploads/origins/318d2c77-a0c0-4693-a783-ce67d35d7cbf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=650f54bf4c60f6ea36a458ed8b3e2db9 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/74a0c2eb/uploads/origins/318d2c77-a0c0-4693-a783-ce67d35d7cbf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7ba01a036e8f8f7ba007ca102357ca59", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/74a0c2eb/uploads/origins/318d2c77-a0c0-4693-a783-ce67d35d7cbf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7ba01a036e8f8f7ba007ca102357ca59, https://si.imgix.net/74a0c2eb/uploads/origins/318d2c77-a0c0-4693-a783-ce67d35d7cbf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=086ca866355a956ba33a35e7c1954383 2x, https://si.imgix.net/74a0c2eb/uploads/origins/318d2c77-a0c0-4693-a783-ce67d35d7cbf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a5b731466c55afd54c38520fc79c5d2a 3x"}, "body": "お世話になっております、いつもイラストもポストも楽しく拝見させていただいております。\namecoさんの描かれる女の子がとても可愛く好きで今回リクエストさせていただきます。\n\n早速ですが頼みたいキャラクターはURL先に記載のキャラクターになります。 (Googleドライブにまとめてあります)\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1WV5rU2_QLxP_p61xGeZQbhw5Pf7K20N1?usp=share_link\n\n\nイラストの構図やシチュエーション、表情はお任せいたします、NGなどはないため描きやすいように描いていただければと思います。 \n\n<サイズ> サイズ指定無し\n<形式> JPEG \n<解像度> 300〜350dpi \n<用途> SNSなどのアイコンorヘッダー、スマホの待ち受けor PCの壁紙いずれかで使わせていただく可能性があります。(SNSの場合ID記載いたします。)\n\n以下、イラスト制作にあたって何かしら参考になれば幸いです。\n\n【モチーフ】椿\n\n【容姿、服装の特徴(重要部分)】\n・チャームポイントは下まつげ\n・1番長いサイドテールの毛先に赤メッシュ\n・髪のハイライトは赤\n・装飾の十字架は全先端が尖っている\n\n【性格や雰囲気】\n少し気の強い凛々しい女性\n可愛いものが好きで乙女チックな面もある\n(グラブルのイルザに近いイメージ)\n表情や感情は豊かめ\n\n【好きなもの】\n可愛いもの、鳥\n\nもし小物やモチーフを追加する場合は煙管、扇子、椿、鳥のいずれかをお願いいたします。(複数でもどれか一つでも小物を描かなくても可)\n\nもし鳥を描いていただける場合はサザナミインコのクリームイノという種類の鳥か、参考画像の方に載せているツノの生えた黒い鳥のマスコットキャラをお願い致します。\n参考画像はこちらでご確認いただけますと幸いです。↓ (Googleドライブに参考画像をまとめております。)\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1K1SYDbl3mGqzinj54YXR7sQljwrz7H9k?usp=share_link\n\n上記の内容でお受けいただけるようでしたらよろしくお願いいたします。", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 340340, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "こしき", "screen_name": "cosiki_UAU", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1684931543209512960/BVSmpkEO.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1673523474281955328/1690553970/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 7, "complete_expiration_days": 70, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "nc": 128}, {"id": 